@startuml

title WallRunner v3.0 — 玩家生命周期状态图（已修正：代码实现为字段组合）

[*] --> Idle : 初始化
Idle --> Climbing : 游戏开始
Climbing --> Jumping : 按下跳跃键
Jumping --> Climbing : 碰到墙壁
Climbing --> Blocked : 碰到障碍物
Blocked --> Climbing : 障碍物移开
Jumping --> KnockedBack : 被撞击
Climbing --> KnockedBack : 被撞击
KnockedBack --> Returning : 开始回归墙壁
Returning --> Climbing : 回到墙壁
KnockedBack --> Dead : 击退超时+掉出画面
Climbing --> Dead : 掉出死亡线
Jumping --> Dead : 掉出死亡线
Blocked --> Dead : 掉出死亡线
Dead --> Spectating : 还有生命
Spectating --> Climbing : 按跳跃键重生
Dead --> Eliminated : 生命归零
Eliminated --> [*] : 游戏结束

note right of Idle
  代码实现：Player.active = true,
  Player.jumping = false,
  Player.knockedBack = false
end note

note right of Climbing
  代码实现：Player.jumping = false,
  Player.knockedBack = false,
  Player.returningToWall = false
end note

note right of Jumping
  代码实现：Player.jumping = true
end note

note right of KnockedBack
  代码实现：Player.knockedBack = true,
  Player.returningToWall = false
end note

note right of Returning
  代码实现：Player.knockedBack = true,
  Player.returningToWall = true
end note

note right of Dead
  代码实现：由 DeathSystem.applyDeath() 触发
  lives--，若 lives > 0 则调用 respawnPlayer()
end note

note right of Spectating
  代码实现：Player.spectator = true,
  Player.active = false
  摄像机跟随最靠前存活玩家
end note

note right of Eliminated
  代码实现：Player.lives <= 0,
  Player.active = false
end note

note bottom
  【重要说明】本状态图为概念模型，
  代码中未使用显式 State 模式或状态机框架。
  所有状态通过 Player 类的布尔字段隐式表达：
  jumping, knockedBack, returningToWall, active, spectator, blocked
end note
@enduml
